## Composite locations

Composite locations target multiple simple locations.

For example, `loc.header()` includes both `loc.title()` and `loc.subtitle()`.

::: {#583fe8a8 .cell execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    GT(pl_exibble)
    .tab_header("A title", "A subtitle")
    .tab_style(
        style.fill("yellow"),
        loc.header(),
    )
)
```

